<section class="band"><div class="wrap">
<h2>What we hold until people use it</h2>
<div class="cards">
<article class="card"><h3>Scope</h3><p>It stays tied to the decision the report has to support. A new request joins the work only when it changes that decision.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>Owners</h3><p>A name for the project, a name for keeping the report current, and a name for who can see which rows.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>The calendar</h3><p>A timeline the business can see, including the day people are told what changed.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>Training</h3><p>It happens on the report, before the meeting that needs it. We check afterward that people can open it and answer the question.</p></article>
</div>
</div></section>
